    # game/scripts/Dialogs/dialogue_bank.rpy:1228
    old "Mm. I'll allow it. You stop when I say."
    new "Мм. Разрешаю. Остановишься, когда скажу."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/dialogue_bank.rpy:1228
    old "Go ahead. Since I'm in a good mood."
    new "Давай. Раз уж я в хорошем настроении."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/dialogue_bank.rpy:1228
    old "You really did great back there."
    new "Да, я там правда отлично справилась."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/dialogue_bank.rpy:1228
    old "Yeah, that run was impressive."
