    # game/scripts/Dialogs/dialogue_bank.rpy:1228
    old "I could have done better, but thanks."
    new "Могла и лучше, но спасибо."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/dialogue_bank.rpy:1228
    old "It was okay. I'm not satisfied yet."
    new "Нормально было. Я ещё не довольна."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/dialogue_bank.rpy:1228
    old "D-don't just say it like that..."
    new "Н-не говори так вот просто..."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/dialogue_bank.rpy:1228
    old "You can't just drop that out of nowhere."
    new "Нельзя вот так ни с того ни с сего такое выдавать."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/dialogue_bank.rpy:1228
    old "Oh? Noticed, did you?"
    new "О? Заметил, значит?"

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/dialogue_bank.rpy:1228
    old "I guess I don't look too bad today."
    new "Наверное, я сегодня и правда неплохо выгляжу."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/dialogue_bank.rpy:1228
