    # game/scripts/Dialogs/dialogue_bank.rpy:1228
    old "Glad you like what you see."
    new "Рада, что тебе нравится то, что ты видишь."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/dialogue_bank.rpy:1228
    old "That is one way to say it."
    new "Ну, можно и так сказать."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/dialogue_bank.rpy:1228
    old "You're bold today, I'll give you that."
    new "Смелый ты сегодня, надо признать."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/dialogue_bank.rpy:1228
    old "Maybe keep your eyes a bit higher."
    new "Может, поднимешь глаза чуть повыше?"

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/dialogue_bank.rpy:1228
    old "You could have phrased that a lot better."
